# credential-guard allowlist — copy to .claude/credential-guard.allow
# One entry per line. Plain text = substring match on the detected secret.
# /regex/ = JavaScript regular expression tested against the detected secret.
# Lines starting with # are comments.

# Stripe's published test-mode key shapes are safe to send to api.stripe.com in test mode:
# sk_test_
# A dummy bearer used by a local fixture server:
# Bearer local-dev-token-0000000000000000
# /^sk-local-[a-z0-9]+$/
